# Loaded by voice_agent.server.main() via envfile.py — a real environment variable always wins
# over a value in this file. Copy to .env for local use: cp .env.example .env  (.env is gitignored)

# --- llm.py (opt-in OpenAIChatPolicy reply generation) -------------------------------------------
# Unset (the default): the agent uses GroundedPolicy — replies assembled only from what ADARA
# actually resolved, source="grounded_template", never invented.
#
# Set: the agent switches to OpenAIChatPolicy instead — freeform replies from an OpenAI chat model,
# source="openai:<model>". No ADARA context/knowledge-pack grounding is injected; the transcript
# goes to the model as-is, plus recent turn history for conversational continuity. Treat this as a
# real credential: rotate it if it is ever pasted into a chat, a ticket, or a screenshot.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
